      "content": "but breathing in the quiet doesnt change the fact that i have no one. it doesnt make the emptiness go away. it just feels like im stuck in this limbo where i'm still here but i don't actually matter to anyone. it feels so heavy and permanent. like there's just no way to actually be okay again.",
